{"id": "EUVD-2026-104681", "enisaUuid": "9d07c6b7-97be-380f-a5fc-fb4d7f0d6d3c", "description": "LangAlpha through 2026.09.07 contains an improper isolation vulnerability that places all tenants' sandbox containers on Docker's shared default bridge network with inter-container communication enabled. Authenticated users with code execution in their own sandbox can connect directly to other tenants' containers, bypassing require_workspace_owner checks to read files such as vault secrets from exposed servers.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T00:46:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T14:34:42", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:H/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://www.lasso.security/vulnerability-database/cve-2026-109441", "https://github.com/ginlix-ai/LangAlpha/blob/435a5a44fabdeb33e409a62d233a936d96241c86/src/ptc_agent/config/core.py#L295", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/langalpha-through-2026.09.07-cross-tenant-sandbox-exposure-via-shared-docker-bridge"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109441", "GHSA-g5q6-qcmx-6vw9"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.36, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "192077fb-7ed6-381a-b8ed-eaa35ebb9144", "product": {"name": "LangAlpha", "vendor": {"name": "ginlix-ai"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642026.09.07"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5fcd1721-7edf-312b-88ff-186ec75cdd25", "vendor": {"name": "ginlix-ai"}}], "isExploited": false}